            0.086,
            0.622,
            0.106
          ],
          "content": "? **Simplify each of the following expressions:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.184,
            0.124,
            0.595,
            0.144
          ],
          "content": "$p + p + p + p , p + p + p + q , p + q + p - q$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.184,
            0.146,
            0.472,
            0.166
          ],
          "content": "(b) $p - q + p - q , p + q - p + q$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.184,
            0.168,
            0.483,
            0.187
          ],
          "content": "$p+q-(p+q),p-q-p-q$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.184,
            0.19,
            0.49,
            0.209
          ],
          "content": "(d) $2d - d - d - d, 2d - d - d - c$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.184,
            0.212,
            0.522,
            0.231
          ],
          "content": "$2d - d - (d - c), 2d - (d - d) - c$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.184,
            0.235,
            0.345,
            0.253
          ],
          "content": "**(f) 2d – d – c – c**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.258,
            0.17,
            0.274
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.272,
            0.755,
            0.316
          ],
          "content": "(a) 4p, 3p + q, 2p (b) 2p – 2q, 2q (c) 0, –2q (d) – d, – c (e) c, 2d – c (f) d – 2c"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.329,
            0.881,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": "**Some simplifications of algebraic expressions are done below. The expression on the right–hand side should be in its simplest form.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.388,
            0.712,
            0.407
          ],
          "content": "**Observe each of them and see if there is a mistake.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.41,
            0.881,
            0.451
          ],
          "content": "● **If you think there is a mistake, try to explain what might have gone wrong.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.475,
            0.169,
            0.491
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.455,
            0.467,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": "**Then, simplify it correctly.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.504,
            0.88,
            0.848
          ],
          "content": "| Sr. No. | Expression | Simplest Form | Correct Simplest form |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | 3a+ 2b | 5 | 3a+ 2b |\n| 2 | 3b-2b-b | 0 | 0 |\n| 3 | 6 (p + 2) | 6p+ 8 | 6p+12 |\n| 4 | (4x+ 3y) -(3x+ 4y) | x +5 | x-y |\n| 5 | 5 -(2 -6z) | 3 -6z | 3 + 6z |\n| 6 | 2 + (x+ 3) | 2x-6 | x+ 5 |\n| 7 | 2y+ (3y-6) | -y+ 6 | 5y-6 |\n| 8 | 7p-p+ 5q-2q | 7p+ 3q | 6p+ 3q |\n| 9 | 5 (2w+ 3x+ 4w) | 10w+ 15x+ 20w | 30w+ 15x |\n| 10 | 3j+ 6k+ 9h+ 12 | 3 (j+ 2k+ 3h+ 4) | 3j+ 6k+ 9h+ 12 |\n| 11 | 4 (2r+ 3s+ 5) | -20 -8r-12s | 8r+ 12s+ 20 |",
